WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.621
- Welcome back!

00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:03.331
- I'm so happy to be here!

00:00:03.331 --> 00:00:06.331
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.092
- Go ahead its all right.

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:10.925
It's alright.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.460
Do you get that just
when you enter Target?

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:15.930
People are just like, "wow!"

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.430
- I wish.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.074
- So wait, do you get into Christmas?

00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:21.420
- Oh, I love love Christmas.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.670
It is my favorite holiday.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:24.503
- [Kelly] Me too.

00:00:24.503 --> 00:00:25.336
- [Michelle] I love it!

00:00:25.336 --> 00:00:28.860
And we usually spend Christmas in Hawaii.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.300
- Which is kind of different.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.133
- [Michelle] It is.

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:31.966
- Not very snowy.

00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:34.410
- Not very snowy, but nice.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.330
It's where Barack is from,

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.770
so that's where his family is.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.060
And because it's so far away

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.730
it's really the time we
get to spend with them.

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.200
So it's become a tradition.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.100
- I love Hawaii.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.940
Do you love Hawaii?

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.871
- That was half the reason why I said yes.

00:00:46.871 --> 00:00:49.230
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.775
In-laws,

00:00:50.775 --> 00:00:51.691
beach, sun.

00:00:51.691 --> 00:00:53.517
It's like, "I think I love you."

